OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788162554
OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FWords by ITV News Producer, Kieran
OL,7,FCarter
OL,9,FLondon's Kings Cross Steelers rugby
OL,10,Fclub have won the world's most
OL,11,Fprestigious competition for
OL,12,Finternational gay rugby, the Bingham
OL,13,FCup.
OL,15,FThe tournament, held every two years,
OL,16,Ftook place this year in Brisbane,
OL,17,FAustralia, with around 50 teams
OL,18,Fcompeting to take home the trophy.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/9
