PN,31702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788162554
OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FAfter a competition run in which the
OL,7,Fclub's first team finished at the top
OL,8,Fof the pool stages, conceding no
OL,9,Ftries, the Steelers secured victories
OL,10,Fin the semi-finals, 8-5 against
OL,11,Fcompetition hosts the Brisbane
OL,12,FHustlers, and a 12-5 final victory
OL,13,Fagainst the tournament's historically
OL,14,Fmost successful team, the Sydney
OL,15,FConvicts.
OL,17,FIt is the second time the Bingham Cup
OL,18,Fhas been brought back to the capital,
OL,19,Fwith the Steelers winning the trophy
OL,20,Fat 2022's Ottawa tournament as well.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
