FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788162554
OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FThe team's coach, Bryan Vester, said
OL,7,Fhe "couldn't be prouder" of the group.
OL,9,FHe added: "They've worked incredibly
OL,10,Fhard for each other, trusted each
OL,11,Fother and shown so much character
OL,12,Fthroughout this tournament - to see
OL,13,Fthem finish it by lifting the Bingham
OL,14,FCup is incredibly special, and a
OL,15,Fmoment we'll remember for the rest of
OL,16,Four lives."
