OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FFounded in London in 1995, Kings Cross
OL,7,FSteelers RFC was the world's first gay
OL,8,Fand inclusive rugby club, and just
OL,9,Ffinished celebrating its 30th
OL,10,Fanniversary.
OL,12,FIts formation is credited with paving
OL,13,Fthe way for many more inclusive rugby
OL,14,Fclubs which now exist in London, the
OL,15,FUK, and around the globe, providing
OL,16,FLGBTQ+ players a safe and welcoming
OL,17,Fplace to play in.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/9
