OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FThe rugby club is composed of four
OL,7,Fcompetitive teams, who compete in
OL,8,Fcounty league divisions as well as
OL,9,FInternational Gay Rugby (IGR)
OL,10,Ftournaments and friendlies.
OL,12,FThe club also includes a team of
OL,13,Fveteran players - Kings Cross Steelers
OL,14,FMammoths as well as a pathway to rugby
OL,15,Ftraining programme for new players
OL,16,Fwhich it has run since 2015.
OL,18,FThe club officially partners with
OL,19,Fwomen's team, the East London Vixens,
OL,20,Fand touch rugby team, East End
OL,21,FElectric.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/9
