OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788162554
OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FThe club's victory in Brisbane comes
OL,7,Ffresh off a gold medal-winning
OL,8,Fperformance in the 2026 Gay Games,
OL,9,Fheld this year in Valencia.
OL,11,FThe Gay Games is the world's largest
OL,12,FLGBTQ+ sports and cultural event,
OL,13,Fbringing together thousands of
OL,14,Fparticipants from across the globe to
OL,15,Fcompete across a variety of sports,
OL,16,Fwith several London sports teams all
OL,17,Fentering the competition.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
