PN,31707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788162554
OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FSpeaking following the team's Brisbane
OL,7,Fvictory, Jono Elvin, Chair of the
OL,8,FKings Cross Steelers, said: "To have
OL,9,Fthe honour to call myself chair of
OL,10,Fthis club is insane.
OL,12,F"What I've witnessed from both our
OL,13,Fteams over the last week is nothing
OL,14,Fshort of phenomenal. To come to the
OL,15,Fother side of the world and not only
OL,16,Fcompete but to conquer is a testament
OL,17,Fto all involved with this amazing
OL,18,Fclub."
OL,20,FThe Bingham Cup has been held around
OL,21,Fthe world in host cities since 2002.
