OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788162554
OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FIt was set up and named in the honour
OL,7,Fof Mark Bingham, an openly gay rugby
OL,8,Fplayer, who in 2001 fought back
OL,9,Fagainst hijackers on United Flight 93
OL,10,Fon September 11 2001.
OL,12,FMark's efforts, along with those of
OL,13,Fseveral other passengers who all died
OL,14,Fwhen the plane crashed, are credited
OL,15,Fwith preventing the hijackers from
OL,16,Fhitting their intended US government
OL,17,Ftargets in Washington DC.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
