OL,3,CKings Cross Steelers win international
OL,4,Cgay rugby tournament, the Bingham Cup
OL,6,FIn 2028, the tournament will return to
OL,7,Fthe UK, where it is set to be hosted
OL,8,Fby the inclusive rugby club, Leeds
OL,9,FHunters.
